#showas:极限 3
Even more extremely difficult scenario. Two AIs this time which are set to the maximum difficulty of 10.

Map type is "realistic", with 80 planets, pretty much considered the default. The AIs are both set to Royal, using mostly upgraded Guardians.

Your starting fleets are all the default options.

If double difficulty 10 was bad, this makes it worse. Royal is considered one of the hardest AI types in the game, bringing far more Guardians than normal, and every one is at least double the power.

Do I need to mention winning this is a bug?